  "system": {
    "description": "<p>You channel power into a flaming cyclone that roars across the battlefield.</p><p>Choose a creature within <strong>10 spaces</strong>. The target suffers <strong>1 Damage</strong>, and must make an opposed <strong>Reflexes</strong> check, or be knocked <strong>Prone</strong> by the buffeting flames.</p><p>Each extra success increases the <strong>Damage</strong> by <strong>+1</strong>.</p><p>Alternatively, you can choose to sweep the whirlwind across the battlefield, targeting 1 additional creature within <strong>10 spaces</strong> of yourself per extra success.</p>",
